@startuml
title Exceptional Tenant Support Access

actor "Application Administrator" as AppAdmin
actor "Tenant Administrator" as TenantAdmin

rectangle "Global Actor" as GlobalActor
rectangle "Tenant Support Access Lease" as Lease {
  tenantId
  purpose
  allowedOperations
  startsAt
  expiresAt
  terminatedAt
}

rectangle "Tenant A Business Data" as Data
rectangle "Audit Log" as Audit

AppAdmin --> GlobalActor

GlobalActor --> Lease : requests
TenantAdmin --> Lease : approves

Lease --> Data : narrowly scoped access

TenantAdmin --> Lease : terminate at any moment

Lease --> Audit : every action
GlobalActor --> Audit : actual administrator identity

note right of Lease
Exactly one Tenant.

Fixed expiration.

Tenant Admin may terminate
immediately.

Not a Role Grant.

Not a tenant Actor.
end note

@enduml